.labour.gov.in/static/uploads/2026/11/da640b1558a315e81e22ce5ac12f463f.pdf", "scope": "statutory", "quote_or_section": "184. \nWhat is the process for formation \nof negotiating councils? \nWhere no registered Trade Union has \n51% \nor \nmore \nmembership, \nthe \nemployer shall constitute a Negotiating \nCouncil comprising representatives of \nunions having at least 20% verified \nmembership. \nEach \neligible \nunion \nreceives one representative for every \n20% membership, as prescribed by the \nrules.", "extraction_status": "extracted", "source_warnings": []}], "model_check": "supported", "uncertainty": "Automated checks may be wrong; human verification of evidence and applicability is required."}, "elapsed_seconds": 7.519, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 3010, "total_tokens": 3310, "completion_tokens": 300}}
